{"2818520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Serpent and the Crow", "steam_appid": 2818520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tavern hangs suspended in an endless nothing. No ground beneath it. No sky above it. It has been waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Serpent and the Crow is a dark fantasy action roguelite where survival is only the beginning. Fight through relentless hordes across cursed biomes, each run shaped by the choices you make and the build you dare to construct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a47cd1ff51e4848f9a0bc0d02b818645.webp?t=1776814185\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of equipment you find began as a blueprint, salvaged from the dark and forged into something permanent at the Blacksmith. Craft it, upgrade it, slot in runes to bend its stats toward your build. Most gear changes how your character looks, because what you survive in should show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.poster.avif?t=1776814185\" width=690 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.webm?t=1776814185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.mp4?t=1776814185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7b9a54a78649eb44ac7dd4f12ac9b756.webp?t=1776814185\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run begins with an Origin, your starting weapon, skills, and stats. Survive long enough and choose an Ascension, a powerful specialization that transforms your character and conjures a unique Aura. Both can be permanently upgraded through the Codex between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/54cfd6d198a642a6e83379cde697f557.poster.avif?t=1776814185\" width=690 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/54cfd6d198a642a6e83379cde697f557.webm?t=1776814185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/54cfd6d198a642a6e83379cde697f557.mp4?t=1776814185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a38dc6d7e3dc7ede5c78b2e0bff54b8b.webp?t=1776814185\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you level up mid-run, choose from a random selection of Traits, Skills, and Skill Modifications. Layer them together, find combinations that shouldn't work, and build something the tavern wasn't prepared for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7aa8eb5aeb7015006f26689a5d105074.poster.avif?t=1776814185\" width=690 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7aa8eb5aeb7015006f26689a5d105074.webm?t=1776814185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7aa8eb5aeb7015006f26689a5d105074.mp4?t=1776814185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/3fe8a3c86a334ed797827274014e0b70.webp?t=1776814185\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through thousands of enemies across cursed, corrupted biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Risk/Reward Tiers and an Endless Mode for those who want more punishment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging bosses with evolving attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of skills to unlock, upgrade, and chain together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traits, Skills, and Skill Modifications with deep combination potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Fusions that link two Skill Nodes and push your build further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, craft, and upgrade gear with meaningful stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment equipment with runes each run to fine-tune your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origins and Ascensions that deepen with every unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/5ba7d5cdf6149e6054bf1b7ba780e448.poster.avif?t=1776814185\" width=690 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/5ba7d5cdf6149e60